{"Categories":[9],"HiddenTopics":[26],"Topics":[36],"Id":19,"TextResource":{"Name":"assist-card","Translations":[{"Text":"Assist Card","Abbreviation":""},{"Text":"Assist Card","Abbreviation":""}]},"ShapeIndexes":{"ActualShapeList":[{"FloorId":"3","Id":15},{"FloorId":"3","Id":27}]},"Description":{"Name":"description","Translations":[{"Text":"<p>Es imprescindible salir de viaje contando con una asistencia al viajero que este a la altura de las circunstancias para asistir de manera eficaz al turista ante cualquier imprevisto que ocurra en sus viajes.ASSIST CARD es la compa\u00f1\u00eda l\u00edder mundial en asistencia m\u00e9dica.<\/p>\n","Abbreviation":""},{"Text":"<p>It is essential to travel with the correct traveler assistance that is able to care for you when the unexpected happens. ASSIST CARD is the world\u2019s largest organization dedicated exclusively to providing comprehensive assistance to travelers.<\/p>\n","Abbreviation":""}]},"Created":"1488916772","Updated":"1489712587","Picture":{"Url":"http:\/\/front-airport-pudahuel.viadirect.com\/sites\/default\/files\/019_assist-card.png"},"Url":{"Name":"Url","Translations":{"1":{"Text":"http:\/\/front-airport-pudahuel.viadirect.com\/en\/viadirect\/395\/node\/290","Abbreviation":""},"0":{"Text":"http:\/\/front-airport-pudahuel.viadirect.com\/es\/viadirect\/395\/node\/290","Abbreviation":""}}},"LogoMap":{"Translations":{"1":{"Url":"http:\/\/front-airport-pudahuel.viadirect.com\/sites\/default\/files\/viadirect\/logos\/map\/0\/019_assist-card.png","LocalUrl":"Destinations\/19\/MapLogo_1.png"},"0":{"Url":"http:\/\/front-airport-pudahuel.viadirect.com\/sites\/default\/files\/viadirect\/logos\/map\/0\/019_assist-card.png","LocalUrl":"Destinations\/19\/MapLogo_0.png"}}},"ExternalDatas":{"Data":[]},"HasAdditionalInfo":false}